{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45019","headline":"奉贺颜使君真卿二十八郎隔绝自河北远归 · 皎然","name":"奉贺颜使君真卿二十八郎隔绝自河北远归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相失值氛烟，才应掌上年。\n久离惊貌长，多难喜身全。\n比信尚书重，如威太守怜。\n满庭看玉树，更有一枝连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}